<p>Day 10 stretches you low. Four positions built around the lunge - a kneeling lunge with arms reaching overhead, a lunge with an overhead side bend, a side lunge with one leg extended, and a deep runner's stretch folding over the front leg - each held for a 20-count, then the whole sequence run again on the other side. One pass per side, no repeat: a different design from Day 3, where each stretch swapped sides individually and the sequence ran twice.</p>
