<p>The final glute session strips the roster and doubles down on what remains. Straight sets, 60 seconds rest, 5 sets each: 25 bridges, a 20-count bridge hold and 30 side leg raises. The quadruped leg raises have rotated out - three exercises instead of four, but with bridges jumping from 16 to 25 reps and everything at five sets, the session got bigger by getting narrower.</p>
