<p>Three exercises walked into the final week so the glutes could get the biggest numbers in the program - depth beat variety, and your hips are the proof.</p>
<p><strong>Make it Harder:</strong> March the bridge hold - alternate lifting each foot an inch off the floor without letting the hips tip.</p>
